{"3828430": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BIG BALLS", "steam_appid": 3828430, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Big Balls you and your friends will compete in a variety of chaotic gamemodes, unpredictable minigames, and intense races, winner takes all.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off and vote for maps and gamemodes, whoever wins 3 rounds first, wins the game! Use your movement abilities to win!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock over 200 different cosmetics!  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ball Combat</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Damage and ragdoll players by running into them! The faster you hit them, the further you launch and damage them. Hit them hard enough and they crack!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your ball abilities to gain enough speed to crack them in one hit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828430/extras/0c8c2eb693d536833e335c901dcca7e9.poster.avif?t=1787347087\" width=1170 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828430/extras/0c8c2eb693d536833e335c901dcca7e9.webm?t=1787347087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828430/extras/0c8c2eb693d536833e335c901dcca7e9.mp4?t=1787347087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Player Customization </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >change your character look and your ball color!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>29+ Maps and 10 Gamemodes</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828430/extras/c4b7797d59892e774d631e4cdbae21e5.poster.avif?t=1787347087\" width=1170 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828430/extras/c4b7797d59892e774d631e4cdbae21e5.webm?t=1787347087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828430/extras/c4b7797d59892e774d631e4cdbae21e5.mp4?t=1787347087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See your best race times on the Leaderboards,  see if you can hit the global top scores!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Host a lobby in public or private and explore the lobby map while you wait for friends to join!  <span class=\"bb_strike\"><i>and find some secrets</i></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity voice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 20 players (2 players minimum is recommended)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player Customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ragdolling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emotes</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 Game-modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >29 Maps </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High Speed Gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Movement System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ball Combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Public lobbies - anyone can join</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Private lobbies - only steam friends can join</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Racing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed running</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets/Easter Eggs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balls</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring Music by Matthew Pablo</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not Convinced? listen to what john balls has to say about it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828430/extras/758036645d4b47075286a64788191c12.avif?t=1787347087\" width=200 height=140 /></span>&quot;this game is the balls haha&quot; - John Balls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >          </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Big Balls you and your friends will compete in a variety of chaotic gamemodes, unpredictable minigames, and intense races, winner takes all.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off and vote for maps and gamemodes, whoever wins 3 rounds first, wins the game! Use your movement abilities to win!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock over 200 different cosmetics!  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ball Combat</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Damage and ragdoll players by running into them! The faster you hit them, the further you launch and damage them. Hit them hard enough and they crack!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your ball abilities to gain enough speed to crack them in one hit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828430/extras/0c8c2eb693d536833e335c901dcca7e9.poster.avif?t=1787347087\" width=1170 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828430/extras/0c8c2eb693d536833e335c901dcca7e9.webm?t=1787347087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828430/extras/0c8c2eb693d536833e335c901dcca7e9.mp4?t=1787347087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Player Customization </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >change your character look and your ball color!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>29+ Maps and 10 Gamemodes</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828430/extras/c4b7797d59892e774d631e4cdbae21e5.poster.avif?t=1787347087\" width=1170 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828430/extras/c4b7797d59892e774d631e4cdbae21e5.webm?t=1787347087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828430/extras/c4b7797d59892e774d631e4cdbae21e5.mp4?t=1787347087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See your best race times on the Leaderboards,  see if you can hit the global top scores!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Host a lobby in public or private and explore the lobby map while you wait for friends to join!  <span class=\"bb_strike\"><i>and find some secrets</i></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity voice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 20 players (2 players minimum is recommended)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player Customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ragdolling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emotes</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 Game-modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >29 Maps </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High Speed Gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Movement System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ball Combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Public lobbies - anyone can join</